<main class="wrap">
  <h1>Pocket Garden</h1>
  <p class="intro">Three easy herbs and flowers, sorted by the light they like.</p>
  <p class="note">Your choices are not saved. Reloading the page resets all filters and planted marks.</p>

  <fieldset class="filters">
